OL,3,GNEWSAReward of #10,000 offered in hunt
OL,4,Afor sex attacker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #10,000 reward has been offered as
OL,7,Fpolice continue to hunt for a man
OL,8,Fwanted in connection with a series of
OL,9,Fsex attacks in Nottingham.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said the man had
OL,12,Ftargeted sex workers in the Arboretum
OL,13,Farea of the city between October 2025
OL,14,Fand September 2026.
OL,16,FOfficers said they had received two
OL,17,Freports from victims and two reports
OL,18,Ffrom members of the public, but it is
OL,19,Fthought five further offences may have
OL,20,Fbeen committed - including rape and
OL,21,Fattempted rape.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
